From 948f3545c69e8fd7d1253a6a73232170a8e04ba0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Gordon <craighvac@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 20:48:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add Afrezza inhaled insulin support + configurable max
 basal

Technosphere/Afrezza inhaled insulin (peak 40 min, DIA 2.5 h) with per-bolus IOB
tracking, the Afrezza quick-log dialog, navigation and treatment-sheet wiring, inhaled
DIA hard limits, and Wear OS quick-dose logging (4U/8U/12U Actions tile).

Adds the Afrezza max-basal feature: a post-dose temporary elevated basal, enforced in
OpenAPSSMBPlugin.applyBasalConstraints with a hypo guard (pauses below BG 70), COB and
extended-carb awareness, and a configurable rate (DoubleKey.AfrezzaMaxBasalRate) under
the OpenAPS SMB settings. Shared runtime state lives in :core:data (AfrezzaMaxBasalState).

Standard MIN_DIA / MAX_DIA hard limits are left at vanilla AAPS values; only the inhaled
DIA limits (1.5-4.0 h) are added.
